<title>USA: Complete Management Inc Q3 dil shr $0.13.</title>
<headline>Complete Management Inc Q3 dil shr $0.13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine Months ended September 30</p>
<p>					 Actual     Proforma     Actual</p>
<p>					   1996	1995(a)	1995</p>
<p> Gross revenues		$20,029,893 $14,747,258 $9,056,236</p>
